      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GATESYS GEM (2) won both rounds of the Vicbred 4M Series at this circuit and distance, leading from wider than this for a 2.6m win in the final last time. That was her seventh success from 11 tries here. The good draw gives her every chance to add another. JILLIBY DREAMLOVER (3) had tough barriers in both rounds of the Vicbred series but the last two times she started on the front row she won good races in Brisbane including the Great Square. Can show her best from this draw. LOVEMETO NZ (7) was a beaten favourite when third from this barrier first up but he'll be fitter for that. Strikes at 50 per cent at this circuit and distance so the longer trip suits. GOTFEELINGSYOUKNOW (6) resumes off some terrific efforts in the Inter Dominion series including a heat win and a second in the final. Readied with two nice trials and goes very well fresh with three wins and a placing from four tries. Tougher draw for HOPPY NZ (9) but he is in form and is suited up to a distance where he has won four six.",
